    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To fetch an API key from a managed secrets store, I will use the AWS Secrets Manager service, which is a concrete external provider. The code will import the boto3 library, which is the AWS SDK for Python, and use it to interact with the AWS Secrets Manager. The code will be identifiable as using AWS by the import statement and the use of the boto3 library. </thinking>\n",
